_pain.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5342,"key":"doom_bringer_doom","name":"末日","en":"Doom","desc":"对敌人施加末日诅咒，对其进行驱散，并且使其无法施放技能或获得任何治疗效果，同时造成持续伤害。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散","lore":"每当佤什昂都的丧钟传出一个名字，这个名字的主人就必将迎来末日。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"末日对敌人施加破坏效果。末日作用下目标0范围内友军也会受到末日的作用。可以对自身施放末日，使末日作用于末日使者周围的敌人。","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"12 / 14 / 16 秒"},{"key":"damage","label":"每秒伤害","value":"22 / 44 / 66"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"140 / 130 / 120 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"150 / 200 / 250"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"400"}],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/doom_bringer_doom.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_magic_resistance_10","name":"+10% 魔法抗性","en":"+10% Magic Resistance"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_doom_4","name":"+0.2秒 阎刃眩晕","en":"+0.2s Infernal Blade Stun Duration"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_doom_6","name":"+7% 焦土移动速度","en":"+7% Scorched Earth Movement Speed"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_doom_1","name":"+1.5% 阎刃最大生命值伤害","en":"+1.5% Infernal Blade Max HP As Damage"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_doom_9","name":"--10秒 末日冷却","en":"-10s Doom Cooldown"},{"key":"special_bonus_attack_damage_66","name":"+66 攻击力","en":"+66 Damage"}]},{"level":25,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_doom_10","name":"末日施加锁闭","en":"Doom applies Mute"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_doom_11","name":"永久焦土","en":"Permanent Scorched Earth"}]}],"build":{"start_game_items":[{"slug":"gauntlets","name":"力量手套","img":"assets/items/gauntlets.png","cost":140,"count":189,"heat":100},{"slug":"branches","name":"铁树枝干","img":"assets/items/branches.png","cost":55,"count":189,"heat":100},{"slug":"tango","name":"树之祭祀","img":"assets/items/tango.png","cost":90,"count":47,"heat":24.87},{"slug":"circlet","name":"圆环","img":"assets/items/circlet.png","cost":155,"count":46,"heat":24.34},{"slug":"magic_stick","